(text "Compute Module 5 and system control" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 14 0) (effects (font (size 3.5 3.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "d4a2466b-acd8-5143-a993-75288718e89c"))
(text "J3 carries module pins 1-100, J13 pins 101-200 (pad n = module pin 100+n). Stacking height 3.0mm.\nCC1/CC2 are not used: PD is handled by U1, so set PSU_MAX_CURRENT=5000 in the bootloader EEPROM config.\nGPIO map: 2/3 I2C1, 4-7 UART2 Zigbee, 8-11 UART3 Thread, 12/13 UART4 console, 14/15 UART0 Z-Wave socket,\n16 codec reset, 17 user button, 18-21 I2S, 22/23 Zigbee RST/BOOT, 24/25 Thread RST/BOOT, 26 user LED, 27 mic-enabled sense." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15 21 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left top)) (uuid "ca0faf35-f262-576d-b6f3-b542354371d1"))
